  "body": "Welcome to your next chapter in one of Orewa’s most sought-after communities. Set out on 518m2 of Freehold land, this beautifully crafted, single-level home invites you to experience the perfect harmony of comfort, elegance, and convenience.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, you’ll appreciate the peace of mind that comes with a brand new build—crafted with premium quality finishes and backed by a 10-year Master Build Guarantee. Every detail has been thoughtfully designed to deliver daily luxury and lasting value, ensuring your home is as enduring as it is beautiful.\r\n\r\nWake each morning to a breathtaking, elevated sea view and look over the Ara Hills landscapes. In the evenings, unwind in a tranquil setting that offers a true sense of escape from the everyday.\r\n\r\nThe spacious and practical layout is ideal for both families and professionals, featuring four generous bedrooms—including a private master suite complete with a generous walk- in wardrobe.  The heart of the home is an open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, where modern comforts and seamless indoor-outdoor flow make entertaining or relaxing a genuine pleasure.\r\n\r\nA double internal access garage provides secure, convenient parking and ample storage for all your needs. Enjoy the ease and security of coming and going, no matter the weather.\r\n\r\nNestled in the peaceful enclave of Ara Hills, this home is perfectly positioned just minutes from top local schools, the golden sands of Orewa Beach, and the vibrant lifestyle of the Hibiscus Coast. With quick motorway access, your daily commute is effortless, keeping you connected to everything that matters.\r\n\r\nEnquire today and secure your place in this exceptional residence. Move in and embrace the lifestyle you’ve been dreaming of.\r\n\r\nGet in touch now!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
